<title>USA: Enterprise Federal may repurchase stock.</title>
<headline>Enterprise Federal may repurchase stock.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enterprise Federal Bancorp Inc said on Thursday that it had received permission from the Office of Thrift Supervision to repurchase up to five percent of its outstanding shares of common stock for the period ending Sept. 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Enterprise Federal had $235 million in assets at Sept. 30, 1996.</p>
